#ASSERT NOT `s 336(3) the condition is satisfied` TRUE NOTHING (Date 11 11 2026) (Date 11 11 2026)
#ASSERT NOT `s 336(3) the condition is satisfied` TRUE (JUST (Date 11 11 2026)) (Date 11 11 2026) (Date 20 11 2026)
#ASSERT `s 336(3) the condition is satisfied` TRUE (JUST (Date 12 11 2026)) (Date 11 11 2026) (Date 13 11 2026)
